SUMMARY:Hanukkah
DESCRIPTION:Hanukkah is an eight-day Jewish holiday commemorating the rededication of the Second Temple in Jerusalem. Families and communities mark the celebration by lighting the menorah\, sharing traditional foods\, and gathering together. Learning about Hanukkah is an opportunity to celebrate Jewish culture and promote understanding and respect for Jewish communities. \nLearn more at My Jewish Learning.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/hanukkah-2/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Hanukkah.png
END:VEVENT
