SUMMARY:City of West Sacramento Parks & Recreation: Kids Night Out - Pancakes & Pajamas!
DESCRIPTION:The City of West Sacramento Parks & Recreation invites children in kindergarten through 5th grade (ages 5–12) to a special themed Kids Night Out on Friday\, December 11\, 2026\, from 6:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. at the West Sacramento Community Center. For $20 per child\, participants can enjoy three hours of supervised games\, crafts\, dancing\, and a movie\, along with dinner featuring breakfast foods\, hot cocoa\, and popcorn. \nPajamas are optional\, and participants are encouraged to bring a blanket and pillow to relax during movie time. Advance registration is required\, and tickets will not be available at the door. \nFor registration\, visit City of West Sacramento recreation registration website. For more event information\, visit the event listing here.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/city-of-west-sacramento-parks-recreation-kids-night-out-pancakes-pajamas/
